  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your opponent lands a terrible blow on your foot, splintering many bones and mashing the softer tissues into an unsightly paste.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Prone] and lose the foot – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.gz2xy41OSVZ8YBgI]{Amputation (Hard)}. Also, the maimed remains of the foot will have to be amputated within a week (requiring Surgery) or you’ll contract Blood Rot as the shattered foot goes gangrenous.</p>"
    },
